/audio-operator

# Hugo's build output. The workflow and a workstation both write the
# site here, and the lock file guards a single hugo process against a
# second one in the same source tree.
/docs/dist/
/docs/.hugo_build.lock
/docs/public/

# The coverage profile the gate measures, and the report the site
# publishes. CI writes both on every run and reads them once; they
# never belong to the tree.
/coverage.out
/coverage.html
